    "body": "Fixes #41204\r\n\r\nProblem:\r\nThe built-in zip browser opened archive entries as read-only buffers.\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\nAllow zip archive entries to be edited and written back using the `zip` executable.",
    "closed_at": null,
    "comment_data": [],
    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "I verified the tests locally on both Linux and Windows, and they pass. My guess is that the new tests fail on windows CI as the test can't use `zip` and `unzip` are not available in the functional test environment. I could not figure out a way to make zip available to the Windows functional tests CI environment. ",
